  "description": "Room-style app-document facade for .NET MAUI. One collection API; the host picks SQLite, NuvexaDB, Realm, LiteDB, DuckDB, SQLCipher, Firebird, LMDB, RocksDB, or LevelDB. Not a job queue, not OfflineSync, and not a replacement for using Nuventra.NuvexaDB directly. Switching backends does not migrate data.",
